{
  "_meta": {
    "session": "Session 107 — Long-context frontier deep dive",
    "date": "2026-06-13",
    "sources": [
      "Long-context benchmarks (14): RULER 128K/512K/1M, MRCR-v2 8N@256K+1M, LongBench v2, GraphWalks BFS/Parents at 128K/256K/1M, AA-LCR",
      "Frontier long-context models (26): 256K-512K tier (Kimi K2.6/K2.7, Qwen3.6, GLM-5.1), 1M tier (GPT-5.5, Claude Opus 4.6/4.7/4.8/Sonnet 4.6, DeepSeek V4-Pro, Gemini 3 Pro/3.1 Pro), 2M (Gemini 1.5 Pro), 10M (Llama 4 Scout), 100M (Magic LTM-2-Mini)",
      "Long-context architecture (15): Mamba 2/3, Jamba 1.6 Large 398B/94B, Hymba, Falcon-H1, StripedHyena, BlackMamba, Falcon Mamba, RecurrentGemma, MLA, Titans"
    ],
    "notes": "Opus 4.6 MRCR-v2 8N @ 1M 76.0 first model >75% at full 1M. GPT-5.5 74.0 +37pp vs 5.4's 36.6. DeepSeek V4-Pro 59% @1M / 82% @256K strongest open-weights. Llama 4 Scout 10M claimed → 15.6% @ 120K (collapse). Opus 4.8 GraphWalks BFS@1M 68.1+Parents@1M 83.3. GPT-5.2-Codex AA-LCR 75.7. Gemini 3 Pro LongBench v2 68.2. Jamba 1.6 Large RULER avg 95.7 across 4K-256K. Mamba-3 (ICLR 2026) complex-state + MIMO +1.8pp vs Gated DeltaNet half state size. DeepSeek MLA 2.7-4.7x KV cache reduction. Google Titans MAC 2M+ tokens."
  },
